{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2262b91c7df50db00078447f11cc449c20a9894284646aeec6531d6876d159d6", "ja": "（海美の新しい衣装、意外性で話題になっているな！\n本人も、着てみたいって言ってた方向だけど……）", "zh": "（海美出乎意料的新服装掀起话题！\n虽然她本人也说过想尝试这种造型……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "c0c7538e217bcfc87a9bd41242548523967c26355be52402a1ef5cc63fce0126", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9534b849c342805e7f7f6d719f66fcac338377b28422146a299c7b335c952b78", "ja": "ブログ見たよ、海美。すごい反響だな。\nアクセス数が記録更新中みたいだ。", "zh": "我看过部落格啰，海美。\n回响很大呢，阅览数好像还不断在刷新纪录。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "6241e0b1b486a7235d8115f911b32c8a1c01fde3d70744ca93b11533827f824c", "ja": "うわ～、ホントに！？\nコメントも、いつもの3倍増し！って感じだよ☆", "zh": "哇～真的吗！？\n留言数感觉也比平时多了三倍喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c1a244da32f8770490400ae1c793ab6a56693f6098937956671fc5ff9b6745d", "ja": "「海美ちゃんの新しい一面が見られました」\nってコメントとか、もらえたんだ～！", "zh": "还有人留言说\n「看到海美崭新的一面了」耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d5c3f5692b8fb0d5a8a538fb15e524316839748dc61c83af669a661e502b61c0", "ja": "確かに、新しい一面だな！　今までの海美とは\n違った魅力が、よく引き出されてると思うよ。", "zh": "的确是崭新的一面呢！\n我觉得新服装有为海美衬托出不同以往的魅力喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab5d92e5c1263ed5996703a54661f0553a1c1df40a3935007cee01e225f2c287", "ja": "えへへ……そっかな？　うん、でもそうだよね！\nだってこの衣装、すっごくカワイイもんね☆", "zh": "嘿嘿……是这样吗？嗯，说得也对！\n因为这套服装真的很可爱嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "ec0ab0bd90a46d456257659f27eaf226205bbec153f4467d897acbbc90e177e8", "ja": "ヒラヒラしてるし、女子力めちゃくちゃ高いし！\n着るだけで、なんかキラキラ……って感じがするっ！", "zh": "上头有好多花边，超有女子力！\n光是穿着，就有种闪亮亮～的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff77cb79651d7ec52898d8b9ea5bca2a4b7c78c982d25c3761a07aebeedce59b", "ja": "私、この衣装でいっぱいライブしたいな！\nあ、でも着替えるのがちょっと大変だけど……。", "zh": "我想要穿上这套服装尽情表演！\n啊，可是换服装的时候有点麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4b5c74ec157434911d2687e14e0c45738db4ae696c8195b12cdc4c42cca7645a", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？　ライブ中に衣装を\n替える事もあるし、慣れておかないとだな……。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？演唱会上可能会需要换服装，\n得事先让你习惯一下才行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "8170971f5c40b96bcbf438edb2d6afb7da465c8f23d733ca77f26e4106836f23", "ja": "あっ、そっか……そうだよね！\nわかった！　私、着替えの特訓するっ！", "zh": "啊，对喔……说得也是！\n我知道了！那我就来进行换装特训！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1011_p", "source_sha256": "68c36f369fb18b5f1168c43eb389af7b164340dc62dbc4efb4f908052a8a3b2e", "ja": "着替えの特訓？", "zh": "换装特训？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "74362eed6efb45a558da84084fcc1843941731a12afcf739daba76ba5349dbc1", "ja": "そう！　着替えて、1曲踊るので1セット！\nまずは、100セットね！", "zh": "没错！换好服装再跳1首歌，这样算1组！\n先来个100组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "38eee778176f65570267ee6aa7ee9f8b0b6d491cc60d1085beb1b5a2649a2004", "ja": "目指せ、1着替え1分っ！　よ～い……。", "zh": "目标是1分钟换好1套服装！预备～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_1014", "source_sha256": "3947f85de9fe43191269923de37294fd5917da7197c8d25c1eebf73254544b9f", "ja": "ストップ！", "zh": "停！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0104_2000_p", "source_sha256": "85eadde6a6e8709b2a4b37d2fc7ecca2fe22d151adc6e10a71858c95e131b177", "ja": "ストップ、海美！\nそこまで急いで着替えなくても大丈夫だから。", "zh": "停，海美！\n不用急着换装没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
